title: "Seedcase Flower: Turn your metadata into human-readable documentation"
abstract: |
  Flower is a Python package and command-line interface (CLI) that generates
  human-friendly documentation from your machine-readable [Data
  Package](https://datapackage.org) metadata (kept within `datapackage.json`).
  Flower does two things: 1) Display the metadata in a nicer way on the Terminal
  with the `view` command. 2) Generate documentation files using built-in or
  custom styles with the `build` command. See the
  <a href="https://flower.seedcase-project.org">website</a> for more information.
